menu "Last Zone Extraction benchmark"

config LAST_ZONE_BENCHMARK_MODE
    bool "Run deterministic performance replay"
    default n
    help
        Drives Last Zone Extraction from a fixed input sequence derived from
        the logic tick and ignores touch, so raster and frame-time samples are
        comparable between builds. Use this only for repeatable device
        benchmarks, not normal gameplay.

config LAST_ZONE_TARGET_FPS
    int "Display frame-rate limit"
    range 30 60
    default 30
    help
        Rendering limit only; game logic remains fixed at 30 Hz.
        Set 60 when measuring available rendering headroom.

endmenu
